- rule_id: PGM501
  severity: Major
  message: "Dropping index 'idx_orders_customer_id' leaves foreign key 'fk_orders_customer' on 'orders(customer_id)' without a covering index. Queries joining or filtering on these columns, and referential integrity checks, cause sequential scans on the referencing table."
